# C++ v7 provenance status

Source baseline: repository `cpp-course`, version v7, frozen separately from this repository.

## Alpha.1 scope

- 40 lesson titles and ordering are mapped to stable Nexus IDs.
- 6 historical sections are mapped.
- No full legacy lesson body is copied into this release.
- Legacy progress can be imported from localStorage if the old course ran on the same origin.
- The old C++ runner dynamically referenced JSCPP from `felixhao28.github.io`; this dependency is **not** activated in alpha.1. Before a sandbox is restored, its exact version/license notice must be pinned in the third-party register.

Status: **rights/provenance audit in progress**.
